  "summary": {
    "derivative_id": "der:rc4:cb_7b30bb821f1d4696a73b4bb70d701c6c:summary",
    "text": "Australian Philanthropic Services Limited is a philanthropic services organisation operating in New South Wales and Australia (information current to 2026). It runs client events that have included a Marine Conservation session exploring research, conservation efforts and philanthropic opportunities; it publishes website content aimed at donors and prospective donors comparing giving fund structures with direct giving; and it posts public governance announcements such as board appointments. The organisation\u2019s public material presents donors and prospective donors as an audience for guidance on giving structures and notes marine wildlife as a topic of its conservation-focused event. CauseBase does not use these items to infer broader program delivery beyond these stated activities and communications."
  },
